[[Rept Parn Freg]] is a [[Hydra]] [[boss]] that appears in [[Prophet%27s Path]].
He runs a patrol between a teleporter and halfway to [[Augury Rock]], and is often accompanied by one or more [[Hydra (Crystal Desert)|Hydras]]. If in [[hard mode]], make sure to steer clear of the three patrolling [[Minotaur (Crystal Desert)|minotaur]]s,
which cross the path of Rept Parn Freg's patrol.

